Short: CD/DVD disk filesystem (ISO-9660+RockRidge+Joliet+HFS)
Type: disk/cdrom
Uploader: stepan@coreboot.org (Stefan Reinauer)
Author: stepan@coreboot.org (Stefan Reinauer) and others
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Version: 1.10 (31.12.2024)

CDVDFS
======

CDVDFS is a CD/DVD disk filing system for the Amiga family of
operating systems. It supports the ISO-9660 standard, the Rock
Ridge Interchange Protocol, Microsoft Joliet and the Macintosh HFS
format.

The file 'CDVDFS.guide' contains information about installing and
using the CDVDFS handler.

This version of the software is a backport of the AROS CDVDFS to run
on AmigaOS again. Thank you to Pavel Fedin, Frank Munnkert and all
other contributors.

